24
00:00:53,275 --> 00:00:56,257
earth and plants. In 1594, they built

25
00:00:56,257 --> 00:00:59,079
the church of Nuestra Señora de los

26
00:00:59,079 --> 00:01:00,852
Remedios right on top.

27
